h dates, and whether several contracts meet a single need that could have been procured at once.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"plantilla","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["bqhGBX7LVVNPpzdqOdhuWg%3D%3D","8yx%2Bx1S%2FMNiopEMYCmrbmw%3D%3D","dHxGnEPf2IuLAncw3qdZkA%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}